<div class="bde-f-text-506-151 bde-f-text">
<p>Klay Thompson’s salary for 2026-27 is <strong>$5.6m</strong>, eighth at <a href="/teams/miami-heat/">Miami</a> and the smallest of his career since 2014-15. He was paid <strong>$16.67m</strong> at <a href="/teams/dallas-mavericks/">Dallas</a> last season.</p>
<p>His career earnings reach <strong>$306.83m</strong> across sixteen seasons. The salary is <strong>2.71%</strong> of the club’s <strong>$206.62m</strong> payroll.</p>

