<h2 class="bde-heading-506-117 bde-heading">
What Is Klay Thompson’s Contract With the Heat?
</h2><div class="bde-fancy-container-506-118 bde-fancy-container">
  
  
	



<div class="bde-fancy-container-506-141 bde-fancy-container">
  
  
	



<div class="bde-f-text-506-154 bde-f-text">
<p>Klay Thompson’s contract is a two-year deal with Miami worth <strong>$11.48m</strong>, signed in 2026 out of the non-taxpayer mid-level exception, fully guaranteed, with a 15% trade bonus.</p>
<p>It is the fifth contract of his career and by far the smallest. He becomes an unrestricted free agent in 2028 at 38.</p>

