</div><div class="bde-f-text-506-156 bde-f-text">
<p>Klay Thompson’s net worth is published at around <strong>$180m</strong> by Celebrity Net Worth, against <strong>$306.83m</strong> in career salary. Endorsement income makes up a large part of what a player of his profile is paid.</p>
<p>He played three seasons at Washington State and <a href="/teams/golden-state-warriors/">Golden State</a> took him 11th in 2011, a year after he turned 20. His father was the first pick in the 1978 draft.</p>

