<script type="application/ld+json" is:inline>{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","@id":"https://nbasalaries.com/players/klay-thompson/#faq","isPartOf":{"@id":"https://nbasalaries.com/players/klay-thompson/"},"mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"How Much Is Klay Thompson’s Salary in 2026-27?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Klay Thompson’s salary for 2026-27 is $5.6m, eighth at Miami and the smallest of his career since 2014-15. He was paid $16.67m at Dallas last season. His career earnings reach $306.83m across sixteen seasons. The salary is 2.71% of the club’s $206.62m payroll."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What’s Next for Klay Thompson Beyond 2026?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"One season remains after this one, worth about $5.88m and fully guaranteed. He becomes an unrestricted free agent in 2028 at 38."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How Much Does Klay Thompson Earn Over Time?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"A $5.6m season is hard to picture, so here's what it comes to over smaller stretches of time."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What Is Klay Thompson’s Contract With the Heat?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Klay Thompson’s contract is a two-year deal with Miami worth $11.48m, signed in 2026 out of the non-taxpayer mid-level exception, fully guaranteed, with a 15% trade bonus. It is the fifth contract of his career and by far the smallest. He becomes an unrestricted free agent in 2028 at 38."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What Is Klay Thompson’s Net Worth?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Klay Thompson’s net worth is published at around $180m by Celebrity Net Worth, against $306.83m in career salary. Endorsement income makes up a large part of what a player of his profile is paid. He played three seasons at Washington State and Golden State took him 11th in 2011, a year after he turned 20. His father was the first pick in the 1978 draft."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Why Is Klay Thompson Paid the Mid-Level Exception?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Klay Thompson is paid $5.6m because he is 36 and two serious injuries took away several seasons, and the mid-level exception is what is left at that point. He has earned $306.83m and this season pays under 2% of it."}}]}</script>
